--- /Users/hoangpham/source/prv/robot/docs/2026-11-13-web-lab-to-physical/04-r3-linux-physical-readiness-spec.md
+++ docs/implementation/web-lab-to-physical/design/04-r3-linux-physical-readiness-spec.md
